==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sojiro Seta (Enemy)|Sojiro Seta]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

